  "description": "Erection of conservatory at the rear of the house. ",
  "decision_conditions": [
    "&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:20px; margin-right:20px; margin-top:0px&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11pt&quot;&gt;The scale, siting and design of the proposed development would result in a harmful loss of outlook daylight and overshadowing to neighbouring occupiers, therefore constituting unneighbourly development and contrary to:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11pt&quot;&gt;National Planning Policy Framework&amp;nbsp;National Planning Policy Framework (NPPF) &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11pt&quot;&gt;(December 2024);&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11pt&quot;&gt;Policy D4 of the London Plan (March 2021);&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11pt&quot;&gt;Policies SP2, DMD1 and DMD5 &amp;nbsp;of the London Borough of Barking and Dagenham&#x27;s Local Plan (September 2024);&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11pt&quot;&gt;The Residential Extensions and Alterations Supplementary Planning Document (February 2012);&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;",
    "&lt;div style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;&quot;&gt;The proposed single storey rear extension, by reason of its excessive depth in combination with the existing rear extension, would not appear subservient to&amp;nbsp;the main dwellinghouse but would appear&amp;nbsp;an overdevelopment of the modest semi-detached host dwelling,. This is especially given it would result in over 50% of the original external amenity space being covered by extensions and an outbuilding.&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;As such, the proposed development is contrary to:&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;span pt=&quot;&quot; sans&quot;,=&quot;&quot; sans-serif;&quot;=&quot;&quot; style=&quot;&quot;&gt;- National Planning Policy Framework&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;National Planning Policy Framework (NPPF) (December 2024);&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot; style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;span pt=&quot;&quot; sans&quot;,=&quot;&quot; sans-serif;&quot;=&quot;&quot; style=&quot;line-height: 14.98px;&quot;&gt;- Policies D1, D4, D5, D6 and HC1 of the London Plan (March 2021);&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;span pt=&quot;&quot; sans&quot;,=&quot;&quot; sans-serif;&quot;=&quot;&quot; style=&quot;&quot;&gt;- Policies SP2, DMD1, DMD4 and DMD5&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span pt=&quot;&quot; sans&quot;,=&quot;&quot; sans-serif;&quot;=&quot;&quot; style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;of the London Borough of Barking and Dagenham&#x27;s Local Plan (September 2024);&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot; style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;span pt=&quot;&quot; sans&quot;,=&quot;&quot; sans-serif;&quot;=&quot;&quot; style=&quot;line-height: 14.98px;&quot;&gt;- The Residential Extensions and Alterations Supplementary Planning Document (February 2012)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;"
  ],
